        <head>LOCK-OUT OF WARRINGTON</head>
        <p>LOCK-OUT OF WARRINGTON</p>
        <p>PLASTERERS.</p>
        <p>At a meeting of the Warrington branch of the National and Lancashire and Cheshire Master Builders' Federation held on Friday night it was re solved unanimously "That as a body of Master Builders and Affiliated Trades we give a loyal sup. port to the action of the National Association." As a result of this resolution notices will be posted up declaring a lock-out.</p>
