        <p>OBICKSTBRS will be glad to know that Geo. G. Bussey &amp; Co.'s Catalogue is out, and may be obtained from sports Dealers. This Manufacturing Firm is always bent on improvements. One of G. G. B. &amp; o.'s Spscialities for the coming Scissors is the new Mitch "Ball, which, by reason fan improved method of constructing the cover, they guarantee will keep a true shape longer,and wear better than any ball made under the old system. The price remains the Same.—Advt. (2)</p>
